## Demo version

The free demo extension may be used for **evaluation and testing only**. Demo builds limit processing to the first 5 text frames per document and the first 5 files per batch job.

## Full version

A paid license ($100 USD unless otherwise agreed in writing) grants **one user or one production seat** the right to install and use the full signed extension for commercial work.

You may **not**:

- redistribute, resell, or sublicense the full `.zxp` or any part of the commercial build
- reverse engineer or remove license limits from the demo for production use
- publish the obfuscated commercial JSX (`func_bin`) or unreleased source

